   "line": 13,
   "text": "Each API key may send at most 600 requests in one quota window."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 13,
   "text": "A quota window is one clock minute, starting at second zero of the minute in UTC."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 13,
   "text": "When a new quota window begins, the counter of every key returns to zero."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 15,
   "text": "The counter for each key lives in the shared Redis cluster under a name made of the API key and the start minute of the quota window."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 15,
   "text": "Each counter expires two minutes after it was created, so old quota windows clean themselves up."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 17,
   "text": "A request that arrives while its key's counter is below the plan's limit increments the counter and goes through."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 17,
   "text": "A request that arrives once the counter has reached the limit is rejected and does not increment it."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 24,
   "text": "A request counts as one, whatever status the backend returns."
  },
  {
   "file": "plugins/evidence-based-authoring/skills/auditing-ai-context/evals/absent-rule/cases/06-rate-limiting-at-an-api-gateway/old.md",
   "line": 28,
   "text": "Plan"
  },
  {
